HBBSCommon.library/UpperCase                     HBBSCommon.library/UpperCase

   NAME
      UpperCase - converts a string to upper case

   SYNOPSIS
      UpperCase( str )
                 A0

      void UpperCase( char *str )

   FUNCTION
      This function converts a string to upper case

   INPUTS
      str - a null terminated string

